# "When that creature dies this turn, you earthbend 4." The delayed ability's source is Fatal Fissure, the spell that made it,
# not the creature it watches (CR 603.7d). Toph earthbends Forest#1 into a 2/2; Mother of Runes gives it protection from white;
# Fatal Fissure (black) chooses Mother of Runes and Lightning Bolt kills her. Forest#1 is still a legal target for "earthbend 4"
# (CR 702.16b: protection from white stops only a white source's targeting), and gets four more counters: 6.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mother of Runes
Toph, the Blind Bandit
Forest
Fatal Fissure
Lightning Bolt
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

